            "rect": [
                411,
                630,
                24,
                24
            ],
            "text": "Use bucket policy sends no ACL with each upload (the default); the bucket's policy decides who can open files. Request public read asks S3 to make each new object publicly readable through an object ACL, which needs ACLs enabled on the bucket and the s3:PutObjectAcl permission. Neither choice changes the bucket policy, and the policy or Block Public Access can still refuse access, so test the resulting link."
        },
